---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy | ZENTRA Digital Development"
  description="Preliminary notice about information submitted to ZENTRA through the contact form and its processing by FormSubmit."
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main id="contenido">
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="SITE INFORMATION"
      title="Privacy and data use."
      description="This preliminary notice explains what information is requested when you send an inquiry to ZENTRA."
    />

    <section class="section legal-page" aria-label="Privacy notice">
      <div class="container legal-page__container">
        <aside class="legal-draft" role="note">
          <strong>Preliminary document; review is required before it is published as final.</strong>
          <p>The site owner’s legal identity, criteria for retaining and deleting messages, and review for the markets served still need to be completed.</p>
        </aside>

        <p class="legal-page__updated">Preliminary version. Effective date: to be defined.</p>

        <div class="legal-page__content">
          <section aria-labelledby="privacy-form-data">
            <h2 id="privacy-form-data">Information requested</h2>
            <p>The contact form requests your name, email address, service of interest, and a message about your project. Fields are required so ZENTRA can respond to the inquiry.</p>
          </section>

          <section aria-labelledby="privacy-purpose">
            <h2 id="privacy-purpose">Purpose and receipt</h2>
            <p>ZENTRA uses this information to understand the inquiry, consider the requested service, and reply by email. Form inquiries are received at the business email address <a href="mailto:zentra.digital.studio@gmail.com">zentra.digital.studio@gmail.com</a>.</p>
            <p>The site also provides links to start an email or WhatsApp conversation. Those external services process information that a person chooses to send through their own applications.</p>
          </section>

          <section aria-labelledby="privacy-processor">
            <h2 id="privacy-processor">External form processing</h2>
            <p>When you submit the form, the information is sent in a POST request to FormSubmit, an external provider that processes the form and forwards the inquiry to ZENTRA’s business email. FormSubmit may process information under its own terms and privacy practices. Read its <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">privacy information</a>.</p>
            <p>The site does not use its own backend for this form. Please do not include passwords, financial details, or other sensitive information that is not needed to describe the project.</p>
          </section>

          <section aria-labelledby="privacy-storage">
            <h2 id="privacy-storage">Retention and inquiries</h2>
            <p>ZENTRA still needs to define how long messages received in the business inbox will be kept and when they will be deleted. For privacy-related questions, you can email <a href="mailto:zentra.digital.studio@gmail.com">zentra.digital.studio@gmail.com</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section aria-labelledby="privacy-completion">
            <h2 id="privacy-completion">Legal details to complete</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>The site owner’s legal identity and the name under which ZENTRA operates.</li>
              <li>Criteria and periods for retaining and deleting messages.</li>
              <li>Review of external providers’ processing and obligations that apply to the markets served.</li>
              <li>An effective date and legal review of the final text.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</MainLayout>
